Rule 34 (tensor shape matches given tuple shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ndim(v__1) = v_2.len ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = v_2[i]
